    id: 107,
    title: "Tin Can Kids WiFi Phone for Voice-Only Calling",
    slug: "tin-can-kids-wifi-phone-for-voice-only-calling",
    description: `The Tin Can is a revolutionary communication device designed to provide children with a safe and screen-free way to stay connected with loved ones. This "new-school landline" reinvents the home phone for the digital age, prioritizing real conversations over texts, apps, and games. With its retro-inspired design and simple, voice-only functionality, the Tin Can offers a nostalgic yet modern solution for parents seeking to foster genuine communication skills in their children. The device operates entirely over Wi-Fi, eliminating the need for a traditional phone jack and allowing for easy setup and placement anywhere in the home.

A key feature of the Tin Can is its emphasis on safety and parental control. Only pre-approved contacts can make and receive calls, ensuring that children are only communicating with trusted friends and family members. This closed network approach effectively blocks unwanted calls from strangers or scammers, providing parents with peace of mind. The Tin Can also includes a "Quiet Hours" feature, which disables calling functions during designated times like bedtime or homework, further empowering parents to manage their child's communication access. The device comes with a free plan for calling other Tin Can users and an optional "Party Line Plan" for calling regular phone numbers.`,
