    description: `Picture a world where your photos and videos seamlessly interconnect across your iPhone, iPad, and Mac products. This is life with the SanDisk Phone Drive. With reliable transfer rates, you can move photos and videos between your USB Type-C™ Apple devices in an instant. Encryption to help secure your device and simple backup utilizing the SanDisk mobile app makes it so you’re always ready for more. Enjoy a robust and beautiful Metallic Sky finish that's more than an accessory; it's essential. Embrace more compatibility. The SanDisk Phone Drive comes with not one but two connectors so you can easily move files between your iPhone, iPad Pro, Mac, and USB Type-C™ devices. Bid farewell to storage woes and welcome automatic backup with the SanDisk mobile app. Store precious moments and work without the hassle. With up to 256GB of storage, just plug in the drive and quickly free up space. No internet required to transfer files. Now you have the memory you need for more photos, videos and games.`,
