    slug: "aqara-doorbell-camera-g400-wired-2k-smart-doorbell",
    description: `Experience a new level of home security with the Aqara Doorbell Camera G400. This wired smart doorbell provides crystal-clear 2K video, ensuring you never miss a detail. Its impressive 165-degree ultra-wide field of view and 3:4 aspect ratio offer a head-to-toe perspective, perfect for monitoring package deliveries and preventing porch piracy. The G400 is equipped with 940nm infrared LEDs for exceptional night vision, capturing high-definition video even in complete darkness. Video brightness tuning ensures that faces and packages are always clearly visible, without being washed out or too dark. For power, you have the flexibility of using either Power over Ethernet (PoE) for maximum stability or your existing low-voltage doorbell wiring for a quick and hassle-free installation. The on-device AI provides real-time motion and person detection, and you can customize activity zones to focus on critical areas. When a visitor presses the doorbell, you'll receive an instant video call on your phone, allowing you to see and speak with them from anywhere. The G400 also supports quick replies and custom responses for added convenience.`,
