    id: 112,
    title: "Schiit Lyr 5 Fusion Headphone Amp and Preamp",
    slug: "schiit-lyr-5-fusion-headphone-amp-and-preamp",
    description: `Lyr 5 offers the best of both worlds, seamlessly switching between tube and solid-state sound. With Fusion™ architecture, you can enjoy the warmth of tubes or the reliability of MOSFETs. The tube is completely powered down in solid-state mode, extending its life. Lyr 5 features Forkbeard™, an integrated control system that monitors performance, indicating whether you're running in Class A or AB and providing complete control over all functions. It delivers up to 6W RMS through both 4.4mm and ¼” jacks, accommodating both balanced and single-ended headphones. The 4.4mm jack includes Halo™ mixed-mode motion feedback for enhanced acoustics. Safety is paramount, with advanced oversight for DC, overcurrent, temperature, and tube presence. The build quality is exceptional, featuring a 100% linear power supply with two transformers, a relay ladder volume control for perfect channel matching, and full DC coupling. High-quality components like MELF resistors and separate regulated power supplies ensure a high-end audio experience. Designed and built in the USA, Lyr 5 is a testament to quality and innovation in headphone amplification.`,
