    id: 114,
    title: "ROG Strix Morph 96 Wireless Keyboard",
    slug: "rog-strix-morph-96-wireless-keyboard",
    description: `The ROG Strix Morph 96 Wireless is a highly customizable gaming keyboard designed for enthusiasts who crave a personalized experience. Its 96% layout offers a compact form factor without sacrificing essential keys, making it ideal for gamers who need more desk space for mouse movement. The keyboard features a fully modular design, allowing users to easily swap out internal components like the positioning plate and dampening foams to achieve their desired typing feel and sound profile.

One of the standout features of the Strix Morph 96 is its unique lighting design. With light bars along both sides and a translucent PC positioning plate, the keyboard delivers even and vibrant illumination across the entire surface. The hot-swappable ROG NX V2 mechanical switches provide a smooth and refined typing experience, while the south-facing PCB ensures compatibility with a wide range of custom keycaps.

For connectivity, the Strix Morph 96 offers tri-mode functionality, allowing you to connect via Bluetooth, 2.4GHz wireless with ROG SpeedNova technology, or a wired USB connection. The keyboard also includes an intuitive control knob for media playback and volume adjustment, as well as two pairs of keyboard feet for three different tilt positions. With its extensive customization options and premium features, the ROG Strix Morph 96 Wireless is a top-tier choice for serious gamers and DIY keyboard builders.`,
