    slug: "amazon-kindle-scribe-64gb-11-ereader-with-pen",
    description: `The all-new Kindle Scribe is designed for a seamless reading and writing experience. It features a large 11-inch, glare-free, paper-like display with an adjustable front light, allowing for comfortable use in any lighting condition. The textured surface and ultra-fast responsiveness of the screen provide a natural writing experience with the included Premium Pen, which requires no charging. This redesigned Kindle Scribe is thinner, lighter, and faster, offering improved ergonomics and fluid performance. The device comes with a built-in notebook with AI-powered search and chat capabilities, allowing you to easily find information, generate summaries, and chat about your notes to uncover insights. You can also refine your handwriting or convert it to text. The Kindle Scribe allows you to import documents from Google Drive and Microsoft OneDrive to mark up, and you can export your notebooks to Microsoft OneNote. With the Active Canvas feature, you can start writing in documents and books, and the device will create space for your notes by expanding the margins.`,
