    slug: "amazon-echo-show-11-smart-display-with-az3-pro-chip",
    description: `The Amazon Echo Show 11 is a smart home assistant with an 11-inch Full-HD touchscreen display. This new model boasts a 60% larger viewing area compared to the Echo Show 8, providing a more immersive experience for watching videos, following recipes, or making video calls. The device is powered by the AZ3 Pro chip, ensuring powerful performance and enabling highly personalized experiences through Omnisense technology. The Echo Show 11 delivers room-filling spatial audio with crisper vocals and enhanced bass, making it perfect for enjoying music and streaming content from services like Prime Video and Netflix. It also functions as a smart home hub, allowing you to pair and control thousands of Alexa-compatible devices without needing a separate hub. You can easily manage your smart home devices, view camera feeds, and set up routines based on temperature, presence, or visual ID. When not in use, the Echo Show 11 can serve as a digital photo frame, displaying your favorite memories. With Alexa+, you can get recipe recommendations, make reservations, and manage your shopping lists with ease. The device features a 13MP camera with auto-framing and noise reduction for clear video calls, and it's built with multiple layers of privacy controls, including a physical camera and microphone shutter.`,
