    title: "Amazon eero Signal with Flexible Placement",
    slug: "amazon-eero-signal-with-flexible-placement",
    description: `The Amazon eero 6 mesh wifi add-on extender expands your existing eero mesh wifi system, adding up to 1,500 square feet of coverage. With Wi-Fi 6 technology, it supports faster speeds and greater efficiency for your home network. This extender is ideal for eliminating dead spots and ensuring a strong, reliable signal in every room. Its TrueMesh technology intelligently routes traffic to avoid congestion and drop-offs, providing a seamless online experience for streaming 4K video, gaming, and video conferencing. The eero 6 extender is easy to set up and manage through the eero app, which also allows you to share your network with guests and troubleshoot any issues. It also has a built-in smart home hub, allowing you to connect compatible Thread and Zigbee devices to Alexa. The device receives automatic software updates to enhance performance and security, ensuring your network is always up-to-date. It is backward compatible with previous eero generations and works with eero Built-in on select Amazon Echo devices.`,
