    slug: "amazon-kindle-colorsoft-kids-ereader-with-16gb-storage",
    description: `Inspire a lifelong love of reading on the first Kindle Colorsoft Kids. The new display has paper-like color that brings book covers, comics, and graphic novels to life. Where imagination meets color - Color adds depth to their pages and looks beautiful day or night. The first Kindle in color for kids – The new Colorsoft display brings covers and content to life. Kids can explore titles included in their subscription, like Artemis Fowl, Big Nate, and Percy Jackson, in paper-like color that’s easy on the eyes. Get unlimited access to thousands of age-appropriate books with 12 months of Amazon Kids+, an included subscription designed for kids aged 3-12. The Kindle Colorsoft Kids display is optimized for reading in color and is different from the Kindle Paperwhite Kids display, which is optimized for black and white reading. The Parent Dashboard allows you to add books from your account to your kid's library, view reading progress, adjust age filters, set a device bedtime, and more. Designed to keep kids focused on reading with no notifications, apps, videos, or games. Kids can bring their stories to the pool, the beach, or anywhere in between. The adjustable warm light and glare-free display lets kids read comfortably indoors and out, day or night.`,
